{"4508610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "翻翻卡", "steam_appid": 4508610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >翻翻卡支持双端互通，手机端电脑端畅玩体验！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >几十张三国、水浒英雄卡，技能策略扇卡对战！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >挑战各色道馆主，成为翻翻卡的最强王者！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >支持4人好友建房对战，快叫上你的玩伴一起感受童年的快乐！</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >翻翻卡支持双端互通，手机端电脑端畅玩体验！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >几十张三国、水浒英雄卡，技能策略扇卡对战！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >挑战各色道馆主，成为翻翻卡的最强王者！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >支持4人好友建房对战，快叫上你的玩伴一起感受童年的快乐！</p>", "short_description": "翻翻卡是一款动作竞技3D卡牌游戏 玩家将扮演各种角色与其他玩家或boss进行趣味对战 自由组建属于自己的卡组，自由匹配对战 每回合双放各8张随从总计16张随从卡随机分散在战斗区域内 双方玩家轮流扇卡，随从卡初始正面朝上，翻转或出界视为退场 不同的扇卡姿势，距离远近，随从技能，行动卡特效都会影响扇卡结果！ 最后保留至少一张卡的是赢家！ 赢者不止获胜，更可以永久抽走败方上阵卡组中的一张卡，收为自己的战利品！ 完全还原童年的紧张刺激，等你来玩！", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508610/805220e1111c1f3fd3bd972615f01c92a858c0ae/header.jpg?t=1777854831", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508610/47b0015d37966e13fb61fc7f670e17f46bba50ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777854831", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508610/47b0015d37966e13fb61fc7f670e17f46bba50ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777854831", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 550<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li>